01:01:20,000 --> 01:01:26,000
Twist is a 2021 British crime drama film directed by Martin Owen and
co-produced by Noel Clarke and Jason Maza, who also stars in the film.

11
01:07:28,000 --> 01:07:34,000
The film, based on the 2014 Tom Grass novel Twist which is itself an adaptation of Charles Dickens' 1838 novel
Oliver Twist, stars Raff Law, Michael Caine, Noel Clarke, Lena Headey, Rita Ora and Sophie Simnett.

12
01:13:36,000 --> 01:13:42,000
Twist was released on Sky Cinema on 29 January 2021 and was
met with negative reception from critics.

13
